Checked against the file after turnip-a840v2, with Mesa 26.2.0's lookup
(first match; gpu_id first; exact id, patch and fuse wildcards): every chip id
of the table, with fuse ids and all 256 patch values, and the gpu_id Turnip
derives on KGSL, resolves to the same record as before, except the four new
ids and the dropped X2-85, X1-85, X1-45 and Adreno 200;
__info35 equals the 840's __info34 except the six magic registers; no code
refers to the rewritten strings.

